OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 8 JUN
OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GLinton Stephens introduces an
OL,6,     Gafternoon of specially made
OL,7,     Grecordings including Dmitry
OL,8,     GSitkovetsky's arrangement of
OL,9,     GBach's Goldberg Variations live
OL,10,     Gfrom London's Wigmore Hall.
OL,11,G1600FComposer of the Week: Monteverdi
OL,12,     GKate Molleson explores
OL,13,     GMonteverdi's beginnings in
OL,14,     GCremona, with early publications
OL,15,     Gand musical training.
OL,16,G1700FIn Tune
OL,17,     GPetroc Trelawny presents live
OL,18,     Gmusic from pianist Charles Owen
OL,19,     Gand violinist Charlie Lovell-
OL,20,     GJones, as well as the jazz duo
OL,21,     GHis 'n' Hers and their band.
