OL,4,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,5,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,6,     Gsoundscape of classical
OL,7,     Gfavourites.
OL,8,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,9,     GThe CBSO conducted by Alpesh
OL,10,     GChauhan present a concert of
OL,11,     Gmusic from America which includes
OL,12,     Gthe double timpani concerto by
OL,13,     GPhilip Glass and works by Carlos
OL,14,     GSimon and Rachmaninov.
OL,15,G2145FThe Essay: Musicians on the Couch
OL,16,     GHow does music affect the mind?
OL,17,     GWriter Amanda Dalton explores the
OL,18,     Grelationship between the two, in
OL,19,     Gall its forms. She begins in
OL,20,     GVienna, powerhouse of
OL,21,     Gpsychoanalysis and music.
